{"artifact":"baggage-oui-1702","base":0,"original":"Build an interactive single-bag fee explorer for a fictional policy. Economy allows 23 kg, Business 32 kg; Gold adds 5 kg. Charge $15 per excess kg, never negative. Support all integer bag weights from 10 to 40 kg. Show allowance and fee as inputs change.","previousRequests":[],"currentArtifact":"{
  "version": "2b1",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "For one bag, Gold adds 5 kg to the cabin allowance. You pay $15 for each kilogram over your allowance and nothing if the bag is at or below it."
    },
    {
      "type": "ui",
      "source": "root = Stack([cabin, status, weight, allowanceResult, feeResult])\n$cabin = 0\n$gold = 0\n$weight = 23\ncabin = Control(\"Cabin\", 0, 1, [\"Economy\", \"Business\"], $cabin)\nstatus = Control(\"Gold status\", 0, 1, [\"No Gold\", \"Gold\"], $gold)\nweight = Control(\"Bag weight (kg)\", 10, 40, [], $weight)\nbase = $cabin == 0 ? 23 : 32\nallowance = base + $gold * 5\nexcess = $weight > allowance ? $weight - allowance : 0\nallowanceResult = Metric(\"Bag allowance (kg)\", allowance)\nfeeResult = Metric(\"Single-bag fee ($)\", excess * 15)",
      "state": []
    }
  ]
}","controls":[{"type":"Control","binding":"cabin","props":{"label":"Cabin","min":0,"max":1,"choices":["Economy","Business"],"value":0}},{"type":"Control","binding":"gold","props":{"label":"Gold status","min":0,"max":1,"choices":["No Gold","Gold"],"value":1}},{"type":"Control","binding":"weight","props":{"label":"Bag weight (kg)","min":10,"max":40,"choices":[],"value":38}}],"request":"Add a route selector. Domestic stays the default with the same rules. International adds 2 kg to every allowance. Keep my current selections."}
